\"https://royaltyclerk.com/texas/operators/marathon-oil-ef-llc-525398\">Marathon Oil Ef LLC</a></li><li><a href=\"https://royaltyclerk.com/texas/operators/continental-resources-inc-173777\">Continental Resources, Inc.</a></li><li><a href=\"https://royaltyclerk.com/texas/operators/javelin-energy-partners-mgmt-llc-100351\">Javelin Energy Partners Mgmt LLC</a></li><li><a href=\"https://royaltyclerk.com/texas/operators/comstock-oil-gas-llc-170038\">Comstock Oil &amp; Gas, LLC</a></li></ul><p>Files licensed CC BY-NC 4.0. The license covers these files only; the rest of royaltyclerk.com stays under <a href=\"https://royaltyclerk.com/terms#data-license\">its terms</a>.</p>",
